  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Vietnam&#x2019;s Science, Technology, and Innovation Policy Landscape</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The study aims to advance Vietnam and the UK&#x2019;s shared priorities in digital transformation, strengthening the Science, Technology, and Innovation (STI) ecosystem, and promoting inclusive economic growth. It will identify policy and market barriers that hinder innovation. adoption and commercialisation, while exploring effective STI investment models that balance supply-driven research with demand-driven innovation. Based on these insights, the study will 
propose actionable recommendations to foster bilateral research partnerships between UK and Vietnamese institutions, enabling knowledge exchange, technology transfer, and capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
